OL,3,GNEWSAFraudsters made #14m on
OL,4,Atree-planting investment scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men made #14m after persuading
OL,7,Fclients to invest their pensions in a
OL,8,Ftree-planting scam.
OL,10,FMatthew Pickard, 55, Stephen Greenaway,
OL,11,F46, and Paul Laver, 47, all previously
OL,12,Fadmitted to fraud, and Southwark Crown
OL,13,FCourt was told they spent the money on
OL,14,Fluxury cars, holidays, watches and
OL,15,Fjewellery.
OL,17,FOpening a two-day sentencing hearing,
OL,18,Fprosecutors said Pickard was the
OL,19,F"driving force" behind
OL,20,FBournemouth-based Ethical Forestry Ltd.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
